  "notes": "IN1-IN4 to four digital pins; + to 5 V, - to GND. The white 5-pin socket on the +y edge (motor1-motor5, 2.54 mm pitch, keyed) takes the 28BYJ-48's plug: blue, pink, yellow, orange, red (red is the common 5 V). The four LEDs light with the coils. The motor draws up to about 240 mA from the + pin, so use a separate 5 V supply with shared GND for anything larger.",
